GRIDLOCK
Players: p1, p2.
Grid: 5x4.
Colours: red, blue.

p1 plays red at (1,1).
p2 plays blue at (2,1).
p1 plays blue at (1,2).
p2 plays red at (0,0).
p1 plays blue at (1,0).
p2 plays red at (3,2).
p1 plays blue at (4,2).
p2 plays blue at (2,3).
p1 plays red at (3,0).
p2 plays blue at (4,0).
p1 plays red at (4,1).
p2 plays blue at (0,1).
p1 plays red at (4,3).
p2 plays red at (0,3).
p1 cannot move.
p2 wins!